# Optional: only for your own local Teams e2e / token-refresh tooling (not shipped in this repo).
# Not needed for an install. Add to apps/teams/.env.
#
# The Authenticator TOTP seed (manual-entry code, NOT a push-approval entry) is deliberately
# not stored here: a seed beside the password defeats MFA. Store it once in the macOS Keychain:
#   security add-generic-password -s snowflake-agents-embed-teams-totp -a "$USER" -w
# or (non-macOS) in a chmod 600 file: ~/.config/snowflake-agents-embed/teams-totp-secret
# See scripts/totp-secret.mjs. $TEAMS_TOTP_SECRET in the process env still overrides.
TEAMS_USERNAME=
TEAMS_PASSWORD=
# Written by your local token-refresh tooling.
# TEAMS_TOKEN=
